<title>USA: Marion Cty USD 408, Kan. won by Country Club.</title>
<headline>Marion Cty USD 408, Kan. won by Country Club.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Club Bank said it won $3.500 million of Marion Cty USD 408, Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.8811 percent.</p>
</text>
